{"schemaVersion":1,"id":6,"sections":[{"id":"107001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[150,151,152,153],"start":0,"count":23},{"id":"107001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[10140],"start":23,"count":2},{"id":"107002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[160,161,162,163],"start":25,"count":24},{"id":"107002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[10150,10151,10152,10153],"start":49,"count":47},{"id":"107003-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[170],"start":96,"count":12},{"id":"107003-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[10160],"start":108,"count":9}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:150:2","scriptId":150,"text":"获得机密文件后，还没来得及细看内容，就收到了司令部遭到攻击的紧急救援信号。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:150:3","scriptId":150,"text":"“刚修完水电的司令部就被袭击了？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":38,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:150:4","scriptId":150,"text":"“现在去救援的话，还来得及吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":38,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":61,"speaker":"莱尼·博克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:150:5","scriptId":150,"text":"“全速前进的话，可能还有希望挽救一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":61,"right":38,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":71,"speaker":"拉伊莎·斯大林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:150:6","scriptId":150,"text":"“现在说那么多也没用，快点赶路吧。而且附近的其他救援部队应该也会去支援。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":61,"right":71,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:151:2","scriptId":151,"text":"获得机密文件后，还没来得及细看内容，就收到了司令部遭到攻击的紧急救援信号。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":61,"right":71,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:151:3","scriptId":151,"text":"“刚修完水电的司令部就被袭击了？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":71,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":38,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:151:4","scriptId":151,"text":"“现在去救援的话，还来得及吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":38,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1171,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:151:5","scriptId":151,"text":"“全速前进的话，可能还有希望挽救一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1171,"right":38,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":71,"speaker":"拉伊莎·斯大林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:151:6","scriptId":151,"text":"“现在说那么多也没用，快点赶路吧。而且附近的其他救援部队应该也会去支援。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1171,"right":71,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:152:2","scriptId":152,"text":"获得机密文件后，还没来得及细看内容，就收到了司令部遭到攻击的紧急救援信号。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1171,"right":71,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:152:3","scriptId":152,"text":"“刚修完水电的司令部就被袭击了？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":71,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":38,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:152:4","scriptId":152,"text":"“现在去救援的话，还来得及吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":38,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":968,"speaker":"索菲·阿登","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:152:5","scriptId":152,"text":"“必须来得及，我舞装的备用零件还在司令部呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":968,"right":38,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1146,"speaker":"嘉丝莉·鲍恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:152:6","scriptId":152,"text":"“先尽我们所能吧，注意速度别太快，当心敌人的埋伏。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":968,"right":1146,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:153:2","scriptId":153,"text":"获得机密文件后，还没来得及细看内容，就收到了司令部遭到攻击的紧急救援信号。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":968,"right":1146,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:153:3","scriptId":153,"text":"“刚修完水电的司令部就被袭击了？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1146,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":38,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:153:4","scriptId":153,"text":"“现在去救援的话，还来得及吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":38,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1158,"speaker":"陈雯兰","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:153:5","scriptId":153,"text":"“如果丢下你们的话，绝对来得及。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1158,"right":38,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1170,"speaker":"夏虹萤","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:153:6","scriptId":153,"text":"“但我们不知道这一路上还会遇到什么事情，所以最好不要这么做吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1158,"right":1170,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:153:7","scriptId":153,"text":"“嗯，谨慎行事总是好的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1170,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1158,"speaker":"陈雯兰","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:153:8","scriptId":153,"text":"“是的，所以我说的只是假设。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1158,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-PROLOGUE:153:9","scriptId":153,"text":"“希望司令部的损伤不要太大，不然就要向总部申请修理补助了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1158,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-EPILOGUE:10140:1","scriptId":10140,"text":"“越是需要争分夺秒的时候，就越容易给我出乱子。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1158,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107001-EPILOGUE:10140:2","scriptId":10140,"text":"“前方敌人信号已经消失，可以继续前进。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":1158,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:160:2","scriptId":160,"text":"众人以最快速度返回司令部。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":1158,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:160:3","scriptId":160,"text":"和报告的一样，大量战车兽盘踞在司令部附近。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":1158,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":61,"speaker":"莱尼·博克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:160:4","scriptId":160,"text":"“据观察，前方正有部队在与战车兽进行交战。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":61,"right":1158,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":71,"speaker":"拉伊莎·斯大林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:160:5","scriptId":160,"text":"“果然有救援部队比我们先到了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":61,"right":71,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:160:6","scriptId":160,"text":"“佐伊准备加入战斗序列！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":71,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:160:7","scriptId":160,"text":"“批准，你们从敌军后方突袭，和救援部队来个前后夹击！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:161:2","scriptId":161,"text":"众人以最快速度返回司令部。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:161:3","scriptId":161,"text":"和报告的一样，大量战车兽盘踞在司令部附近。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1171,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:161:4","scriptId":161,"text":"“据观察，前方正有部队在与战车兽进行交战。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1171,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":71,"speaker":"拉伊莎·斯大林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:161:5","scriptId":161,"text":"“果然有救援部队比我们先到了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1171,"right":71,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:161:6","scriptId":161,"text":"“佐伊准备加入战斗序列！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":71,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:161:7","scriptId":161,"text":"“批准，你们从敌军后方突袭，和救援部队来个前后夹击！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:162:2","scriptId":162,"text":"众人以最快速度返回司令部。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:162:3","scriptId":162,"text":"和报告的一样，大量战车兽盘踞在司令部附近。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":968,"speaker":"索菲·阿登","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:162:4","scriptId":162,"text":"“很好，前方观测到有其他队伍正在与战车兽群作战。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":968,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1146,"speaker":"嘉丝莉·鲍恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:162:5","scriptId":162,"text":"“呼……谢天谢地。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":968,"right":1146,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:162:6","scriptId":162,"text":"“佐伊准备加入战斗序列！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":1146,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:162:7","scriptId":162,"text":"“批准，你们从敌军后方突袭，和救援部队来个前后夹击！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:163:2","scriptId":163,"text":"众人以最快速度返回司令部。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:163:3","scriptId":163,"text":"和报告的一样，大量战车兽盘踞在司令部附近。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1170,"speaker":"夏虹萤","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:163:4","scriptId":163,"text":"“报告，有部队正在与战车兽群交火，司令部还未受到攻击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1170,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1158,"speaker":"陈雯兰","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:163:5","scriptId":163,"text":"“漂亮，虽然不知道是什么队伍，但她们绝对是本次战斗的功臣。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1170,"right":1158,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:163:6","scriptId":163,"text":"“佐伊准备加入战斗序列！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":1158,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-PROLOGUE:163:7","scriptId":163,"text":"“批准，你们从敌军后方突袭，和救援部队来个前后夹击！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10150:1","scriptId":10150,"text":"多亏了支援部队，成功延缓了战车兽的攻势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10150:2","scriptId":10150,"text":"硝烟散去，终于得以看见支援部队的身影。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10150:3","scriptId":10150,"text":"“谢谢你们，真是及时的支援。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10150:4","scriptId":10150,"text":"“区区小事何足挂齿，我是队长奈乐·隆美尔。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10150:5","scriptId":10150,"text":"“啊，奈乐！好久不见！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":109,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10150:6","scriptId":10150,"text":"“这不是吊车尾佐伊么。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10150:7","scriptId":10150,"text":"“额……不要旧事重提，那都是过去的事情了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":71,"speaker":"拉伊莎·斯大林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10150:8","scriptId":10150,"text":"“奈乐……奈乐，哦！她就是那个跳级毕业的天才少女！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":71,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":109,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10150:9","scriptId":10150,"text":"“正是在下。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":71,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":61,"speaker":"莱尼·博克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10150:10","scriptId":10150,"text":"“她和你是同期？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":61,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10150:11","scriptId":10150,"text":"“曾经同期过……但是她后来又跳级了，所以比我早毕业……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10150:12","scriptId":10150,"text":"“好了，废话不多，先去和我的队员们汇合吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10151:1","scriptId":10151,"text":"多亏了支援部队，成功延缓了战车兽的攻势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10151:2","scriptId":10151,"text":"硝烟散去，终于得以看见支援部队的身影。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10151:3","scriptId":10151,"text":"“谢谢你们，真是及时的支援。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10151:4","scriptId":10151,"text":"“区区小事何足挂齿，我是队长奈乐·隆美尔。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10151:5","scriptId":10151,"text":"“啊，奈乐！好久不见！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":109,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10151:6","scriptId":10151,"text":"“这不是吊车尾佐伊么。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10151:7","scriptId":10151,"text":"“额……不要旧事重提，那都是过去的事情了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":71,"speaker":"拉伊莎·斯大林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10151:8","scriptId":10151,"text":"“奈乐……奈乐，哦！她就是那个跳级毕业的天才少女！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":71,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":109,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10151:9","scriptId":10151,"text":"“正是在下。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":71,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1171,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10151:10","scriptId":10151,"text":"“她和你是同期？不会吧？差距那么大？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1171,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10151:11","scriptId":10151,"text":"“曾经同期过……但是她后来又跳级了，所以比我早毕业……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10151:12","scriptId":10151,"text":"“好了，废话不多，先去和我的队员们汇合吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10152:1","scriptId":10152,"text":"多亏了支援部队，成功延缓了战车兽的攻势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10152:2","scriptId":10152,"text":"硝烟散去，终于得以看见支援部队的身影。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10152:3","scriptId":10152,"text":"“谢谢你们，真是及时的支援。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10152:4","scriptId":10152,"text":"“区区小事何足挂齿，我是队长奈乐·隆美尔。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10152:5","scriptId":10152,"text":"“啊，奈乐！好久不见！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":109,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10152:6","scriptId":10152,"text":"“这不是吊车尾佐伊么。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10152:7","scriptId":10152,"text":"“额……不要旧事重提，那都是过去的事情了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1151,"speaker":"嘉丝莉·鲍恩","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10152:8","scriptId":10152,"text":"“奈乐……我好像在哪里听过这个名字……？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1151,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":968,"speaker":"索菲·阿登","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10152:9","scriptId":10152,"text":"“佐伊和奈乐竟然是同期？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":968,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10152:10","scriptId":10152,"text":"“曾经同期过……但是她后来又跳级了，所以比我早毕业……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10152:11","scriptId":10152,"text":"“好了，废话不多，先去和我的队员们汇合吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10153:1","scriptId":10153,"text":"多亏了支援部队，成功延缓了战车兽的攻势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10153:2","scriptId":10153,"text":"硝烟散去，终于得以看见支援部队的身影。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10153:3","scriptId":10153,"text":"“谢谢你们，真是及时的支援。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10153:4","scriptId":10153,"text":"“区区小事何足挂齿，我是队长奈乐·隆美尔。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10153:5","scriptId":10153,"text":"“啊，奈乐！好久不见！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":109,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10153:6","scriptId":10153,"text":"“这不是吊车尾佐伊么。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10153:7","scriptId":10153,"text":"“额……不要旧事重提，那都是过去的事情了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1170,"speaker":"夏虹萤","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10153:8","scriptId":10153,"text":"“你和佐伊是同期？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1170,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":109,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10153:9","scriptId":10153,"text":"“确实。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1170,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1158,"speaker":"陈雯兰","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10153:10","scriptId":10153,"text":"“不过我看你们的战斗熟练程度完全不一样啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1158,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10153:11","scriptId":10153,"text":"“曾经同期过……但是她后来又跳级了，所以比我早毕业……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107002-EPILOGUE:10153:12","scriptId":10153,"text":"“好了，废话不多，先去和我的队员们汇合吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107003-PROLOGUE:170:2","scriptId":170,"text":"一行人随着奈乐来到预定的汇合地点，已经有两位钢舞姬在此待命。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":91,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-PROLOGUE:170:3","scriptId":170,"text":"“队长太慢了！比预计的时间迟了5分钟！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":91,"right":103,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":110,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-PROLOGUE:170:4","scriptId":170,"text":"“因为遇到这群麻烦，给耽误了一些时间，突发情况而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":91,"right":110,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-PROLOGUE:170:5","scriptId":170,"text":"“啊！是急性子的莉娜！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":91,"right":32,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-PROLOGUE:170:6","scriptId":170,"text":"“吊车尾佐伊！？你怎么在这？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":81,"right":32,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-PROLOGUE:170:7","scriptId":170,"text":"“我读书时候的外号……怎么一个个都记得那么清楚……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":81,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107003-PROLOGUE:170:8","scriptId":170,"text":"莉娜看了看被晾在一边的我。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":81,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-PROLOGUE:170:9","scriptId":170,"text":"“看样子这位就是你们小队的指挥？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":81,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-PROLOGUE:170:10","scriptId":170,"text":"“你好，你们的奈乐队长已经其实已经在来的时候介绍过她小队的成员了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-PROLOGUE:170:11","scriptId":170,"text":"“你是莉娜·托卢沙娅的话，那蹲在角落里往我们这里张望的就是普莉玛·派普了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":92,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-PROLOGUE:170:12","scriptId":170,"text":"“……”普莉玛只是望着这里点了点头。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":92,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-PROLOGUE:170:13","scriptId":170,"text":"“恩，基本情况就是这样，战斗还没有结束呢。都别太放松！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":114,"speaker":"战车兽","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-EPILOGUE:10160:1","scriptId":10160,"text":"“呜呜……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":103,"right":114,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107003-EPILOGUE:10160:2","scriptId":10160,"text":"随着最后一只战车兽的倒下，这场司令部保卫战终于拉下了帷幕。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":103,"right":114,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-EPILOGUE:10160:3","scriptId":10160,"text":"“如此规模的战车兽集团怎么才能一下子出现？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":114,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-EPILOGUE:10160:4","scriptId":10160,"text":"“从实地勘察结果，应该是空投部队，周边地区发现使用过的降落伞。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-EPILOGUE:10160:5","scriptId":10160,"text":"“恩，从之前我们小队之前的遭遇来看，这些战车兽明显发生了某些变异，智力水平高于预计水准。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-EPILOGUE:10160:6","scriptId":10160,"text":"“对了，劳您大驾，请把这份资料带给您的父亲，内容我已经确认过了，顺便捎个口信。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107003-EPILOGUE:10160:7","scriptId":10160,"text":"我把具体情况告诉了奈乐。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":113,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-EPILOGUE:10160:8","scriptId":10160,"text":"“这……！？我一定会传达给老爸的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":113,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107003-EPILOGUE:10160:9","scriptId":10160,"text":"“那就有劳了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":113,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["新司令部遭到攻击！？这都是什么情况啊，不是新司令部吗？那么容易被发现？","战车兽数量多得令人费解，有点棘手啊，到底是从哪里来的？","和前来支援的猎虎小队成功汇合。"]}
